{"about_the_game":"The world as you knew it is gone. An unknown virus spread rapidly across the globe, turning the population into relentless hordes of the undead. Cities were abandoned, governments collapsed, and civilization fell into chaos. Now, a few survivors fight to keep hope alive amid the destruction.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCore Mechanics of Gravehold: Survival<br />\r\n- Base Building and Management<br />\r\nConstruct and fortify your refuge to withstand constant waves of zombies, managing essential resources and repairing damage to keep your stronghold secure.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Strategic Traps<br />\r\nSet up a variety of traps and position them wisely to slow, weaken, and eliminate enemies before they reach your base.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Exploration and Resource Gathering<br />\r\nExplore a vast open world filled with dangerous zones and ruins, scavenging supplies, weapons, and components necessary for survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Combat and Survival<br />\r\nFace progressively harder waves of zombies using weapons, traps, and the help of survivors you recruit and coordinate.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Progression and Customization<br />\r\nDevelop your skills and customize your base to adapt to constant threats, tackling dynamic events that challenge your strategy and endurance.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3937350?t=1757928031","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937350/aa18a9fd33d88574eaa0325c5fff64d48989e16f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757928031","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937350/788f2ca321155aa7582927476b9892794e9fc8e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757928031","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937350/788f2ca321155aa7582927476b9892794e9fc8e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757928031","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Shooting zombies will show blood"},"detailed_description":"The world as you knew it is gone. An unknown virus spread rapidly across the globe, turning the population into relentless hordes of the undead. Cities were abandoned, governments collapsed, and civilization fell into chaos. Now, a few survivors fight to keep hope alive amid the destruction.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCore Mechanics of Gravehold: Survival<br />\r\n- Base Building and Management<br />\r\nConstruct and fortify your refuge to withstand constant waves of zombies, managing essential resources and repairing damage to keep your stronghold secure.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Strategic Traps<br />\r\nSet up a variety of traps and position them wisely to slow, weaken, and eliminate enemies before they reach your base.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Exploration and Resource Gathering<br />\r\nExplore a vast open world filled with dangerous zones and ruins, scavenging supplies, weapons, and components necessary for survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Combat and Survival<br />\r\nFace progressively harder waves of zombies using weapons, traps, and the help of survivors you recruit and coordinate.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Progression and Customization<br />\r\nDevelop your skills and customize your base to adapt to constant threats, tackling dynamic events that challenge your strategy and endurance.","developers":["Obsidian Core"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937350/9ed9c79c3bc0930195418516cae9e54d6b6e8061/header.jpg?t=1757928031","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257197923,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197923/movie480.mp4?t=1757928028","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197923/movie_max.mp4?t=1757928028"},"name":"Gravehold Sur